      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "ChessGame       → orchestration + state transitions\nBoard           → piece placement / path queries\nPiece           → movement pattern only\nMoveValidator   → global move legality\nMove            → history / replay / undo unit\nSpecialMoveRule → castling / promotion / en passant\nPlayer          → participant identity",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ChessGame       → orchestration + state transitions\nBoard           → piece placement / path queries\nPiece           → movement pattern only\nMoveValidator   → global move legality\nMove            → history / replay / undo unit\nSpecialMoveRule → castling / promotion / en passant\nPlayer          → participant identity",
      "autoResize": true,
