      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "enum Color { WHITE, BLACK }\n\nenum GameStatus {\n  ACTIVE, CHECK,\n  CHECKMATE, STALEMATE, DRAW\n}\n\ntype Position = {\n  row: number;\n  col: number;\n};",
